le=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_datatype.gif\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Datatyp\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SEEHDSLMObservations-definitions.html#SEEHDSLMObservations.observations.observationBody.patient.electronicAddress\" title=\"NI 2017 (Patient.elektroniskAdress) Angivelse av elektronisk adressinformation som en person har i sin roll som patient. Här avses även telefonnummer. Exempel är särskilt telefonnummer till telemedicinutrustning. Se TelType i avsnitt 6.1.2.2.15.\">electronicAddress</a><a name=\"SEEHDSLMObservations.observations.observationBody.patient.electronicAddress\"> </a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\">0..*</td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#BackboneElement\">BackboneElement</a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">XML-namnrymd: </span>urn:riv:clinicalprocess:healthcond:basic:2<br/>NI 2017 (Patient.elektroniskAdress). Exempelvis telefon till telemedicinutrustning. Se TelType.<br/><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">XML-namnrymd: </span>urn:riv:clinicalprocess:healthcond:basic:2<br/></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr style=\"border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px; vertical-align: top; background-color: #F7F7F7\"><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px; white-space: nowrap; background-image: url(tbl_bck001010.png)\" class=\"hierarchy\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_resource.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Resurs\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SEEHDSLMObservations-definitions.html#SEEHDSLMObservations.observations.observationBody.patient.electronicAddress.value\" title=\"Elektronisk adress, t.ex. e-mail eller telefonnummer. Anges i form av en URI inklusive prefix som anger protokoll. Telefonnummer anges med prefixet ”tel:”, e-mailadresser med ”mailto:” och webbsidor med ”http:” eller ”https:”. Exempel: value=”tel:+46702353535” value=”mailto:lars@gmail.com” value=”http://www.1177.se”\">value</a><a name=\"SEEHDSLMObservations.observations.observationBody.patient.electronicAddress.value\"> </a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\">1..1</td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"><a href=\"StructureDefinition-SEEHDSRivAnyURI.html\">SEEHDSRivAnyURI</a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">XML-namnrymd: </span>urn:riv:clinicalprocess:healthcond:basic:2<br/>Elektronisk adress, t.ex.<br/><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">XML-namnrymd: </span>urn:riv:clinicalprocess:healthcond:basic:2</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr style=\"border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px; vertical-align: top; background-color: white\"><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px; white-space: nowrap; background-image: url(tbl_bck001010.png)\" class=\"hierarchy\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_resource.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Resurs\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SEEHDSLMObservations-definitions.html#SEEHDSLMObservations.observations.observationBody.patient.electronicAddress.capabilities\" title=\"Kan användas för telefonnummer för att ange om numret har möjlighet att ta emot röstsamtal, fax eller SMS. Möjliga värden: voice = Numret kan ta emot röstsamtal fax = Numret kan ta emot fax sms = Numret kan ta emot SMS#xA;Tillåtna värden enligt XSD: voice, fax, sms.\">capabilities</a><a name=\"SEEHDSLMObservations.observations.observationBody.patient.electronicAddress.capabilities\"> </a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\">0..*</td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"><a href=\"StructureDefinition-SEEHDSRivString.html\">SEEHDSRivString</a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">XML-namnrymd: </span>urn:riv:clinicalprocess:healthcond:basic:2<br/>Kan användas för telefonnummer för att ange om numret har möjlighet att ta emot röstsamtal, fax eller SMS<br/><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">XML-namnrymd: </span>urn:riv:clinicalprocess:healthcond:basic:2<br/></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr style=\"border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px; vertical-align: top; background-color: #F7F7F7\"><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px; white-space: nowrap; background-image: url(tbl_bck001000.png)\" class=\"hierarchy\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin_end.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img